msgid "Enter a 10-digit phone number starting with 09 or 07."
msgstr "በ09 ወይም በ07 የሚጀምር ባለ 10 አሃዝ ስልክ ቁጥር ያስገቡ።"

msgid "That day doesn't exist in that month. Pagume has 5 days (6 in a leap year)."
